  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Bakery.png|left|200px|Bakery]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Production Buildings|Machine]]\n |level = 4\n |price = 20\n |time = 10 s\n |slots = 2\n |size = 3×3\n}}\nThe '''Bakery''' is a [[Production Buildings|production building]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 4.\n\nIt is used to make bread, cookies, muffins and pizzas.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Appearance'''===\nThe Bakery is a large, ginger oven with few sacks of flour beside it and a small wooden table in front of it. The floor is tiled. It matches the look of the [[Popcorn Pot]], the [[Cake Oven]] and the [[Pie Oven]].\n\nThe mastered version gets copper-colored parts and a golden star on the side.\n----\n=== '''Building''' ===\nIt costs 20 {{Infoicon|coin}} and takes 10 seconds to build the Bakery. It gives players 3 {{Infoicon|xp}} when completed.\n----\n=== '''[[Products]]''' ===\n{{Building Products\n|Bread|4|5m|21\n|Corn Bread|7|30m|72/8\n|Cookie|10|1h|104/13\n|Raspberry Muffin|19|45m|140\n|Blackberry Muffin|26|45m|226\n|Pizza|33|15m|190\n|Blueberry Muffin|33|45m|230/28\n|Spicy Pizza|37|15m|226\n|Potato Bread|39|45m|284\n|Frutti di Mare Pizza|45|15m|403\n|Gingerbread Cookie|86|30m|273\n|Banana Bread|91|30m|424/50\n|Macaroon|101|30m|421/50\n|Pineapple Coconut Bars|120|40m|284\n}}\n----\n=== '''Upgrading''' ===\n{{Main|Production Buildings}}\nThe Bakery originally has two slots available. Unlocking the third slot costs 6 [[diamond]]s. Players can unlock 7 new slots in total, each new one costing 3 more {{Infoicon|dia}} than the previous one. Alternatively, they can spend a total of 105 {{Infoicon|dia}} to completely upgrade their machine.\n----\n=== '''Mastering''' ===\nA total of 735 hours of production is required to [[Masteries|master]] the Bakery:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 1em 0; border-collapse: collapse;\"\n|-\n|rowspan=\"3\"|[[File:Bakery Mastered.png|150px|Mastered Bakery]]\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★<br />35 hrs'''\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★★<br />140 hrs'''\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★★★<br />560 hrs'''\n|-\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:TruckM10Coins.png|100px]]\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:TruckM10XP.png|100px]]\n|style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:Bakery Mastery.png|100px]]\n|-\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''<span title=\"10% more coins for truck orders\">+10% {{Infoicon|coin}}</span>'''\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''<span title=\"5% more experience points for truck orders\">+10% {{Infoicon|xp}}</span>'''\n| style=\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\" |'''15% faster'''\n|}\n----\n=== '''Strategy tips''' ===\n* Many products from the Bakery require [[egg]]s and [[wheat]].\n* All products sell well at max. price.\n* Very large quantities of [[bread]] are requested in [[boat]] orders.\n* Bread and corn bread are the ingredients of many other products in the game so make sure you always keep a good stock of these.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Backofen\n|es = Panadería\n|fr = Boulangerie\n|it = Panetteria\n|nl = Bakkerij\n|no = Bakerovn\n|ru = Пекарня\n|sv = Bageri\n|vi = Lò bánh mỳ\n|zh = 面包房\n}}\n[[pt-br:Padaria]]\n\n[[Category:Production Buildings]]",
